Today we practise speaking in front of friends. Stand tall, smile, and use a big voice.

5
00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:18.967
Painting!

6
00:00:19.867 --> 00:00:21.834
Painting. Your turn!

7
00:00:24.734 --> 00:00:25.793
Painting!

8
00:00:26.093 --> 00:00:26.990
Great!

9
00:00:27.983 --> 00:00:28.926
Drawing!

10
