Drawing. Your turn!

11
00:00:35.344 --> 00:00:36.368
Drawing!

12
00:00:36.668 --> 00:00:37.565
Wonderful!

13
00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:39.458
Reading!

14
00:00:40.358 --> 00:00:42.233
Reading. Your turn!

15
00:00:45.133 --> 00:00:46.273
Reading!

16
