23
00:01:08.183 --> 00:01:19.310
Hello, everyone! My name is Malis. Today I talk about Hobbies. I like drawing. My father likes fishing. Thank you!

24
00:01:19.610 --> 00:01:21.203
Wonderful speech!

25
00:01:22.217 --> 00:01:29.098
Now you speak. Say hello, say your name, then say: I like drawing. My father likes fishing.

26
00:01:37.398 --> 00:01:38.944
Clap, clap, clap!

27
00:01:39.244 --> 00:01:42.175
Brave and bright! Well done!

28
00:01:43.183 --> 00:01:47.916
